  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JOR Nurses training II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">JOR Sjuksk&#xf6;terskeutb II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektm&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att h&#xf6;ja den professionella kompetensen i klinisk v&#xe5;rd, ledarskap och styrning av omv&#xe5;rdnadsarbetet vid Jordan University Hospital samt att utveckla den kliniska v&#xe5;rdutbildningen vid Faculty of Nursing med integrerad teori och praktik.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project goal is to raise the professional competence within clinical care and management of the nursing care at the Jordan University Hospital as well as to develop the clinical nursing training at the Faculty of Nursing with integrated theory and practice.</narrative>
  </description>
